# Repo-wide rules only — git merges a nested .gitignore with every parent one up to here, so
# src/backend/.gitignore and src/frontend/.gitignore each add their own ecosystem-specific
# rules on top of this rather than repeating it. Nothing below is specific to one app: .env can
# appear under either (or at the root), .DS_Store/.vs//.vscode//.idea/ can appear anywhere an
# editor or Finder touches, and *.log is generic.

# Env / secrets — devops_environments.md: environment variables everywhere, .env locally via
# DotNetEnv. .env.example documents the shape only and is the one exception committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS
.DS_Store

# IDE — .vs/ ties to Trellis.sln at the repo root; .vscode/ and .idea/ can be opened at any
# folder level, backend or frontend included.
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

*.log
